</div></div></div><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__items"><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item--active"><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-header"><h3 class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-heading ffaptosdisplay_4cb7a3de-module__KLyU8q__className heading5 bold">Trade energy and environmental commodities efficiently.</h3></div><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-content gsap-accordion-5050-item-content-0"><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-progress gsap-accordion-5050-progress-0"></div><div><p><span data-sheets-root="1">Transact RECs, carbon, power, clean fuel credits and more through electronic and voice access, with transparent pricing and reliable settlement.</span></p>
<p>Offerings: CBL®, Evolution Markets®, Xpansiv® Data™</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item"><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-header"><h3 class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-heading ffaptosdisplay_4cb7a3de-module__KLyU8q__className heading5 bold">Gain price intelligence that drives confidence.</h3></div><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-content gsap-accordion-5050-item-content-1"><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-progress gsap-accordion-5050-progress-1"></div><div><p><span data-sheets-root="1">Access transaction-based, real-time and historical market pricing to understand trends, value positions and capture opportunities.</span></p>
<p>Offerings: Xpansiv® Data™, Evolution Markets, Xpansiv® Power™</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item"><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-header"><h3 class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-heading ffaptosdisplay_4cb7a3de-module__KLyU8q__className heading5 bold">Manage multi-registry portfolios with ease.</h3></div><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-content gsap-accordion-5050-item-content-2"><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-progress gsap-accordion-5050-progress-2"></div><div><p><span data-sheets-root="1">Track, manage and trade across markets and registries – all from a single screen.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight:400">Offerings: Xpansiv® Connect™, CBL, Xpansiv® Registries™ (NAR™, TIGR™, Xpansiv I-REC)</span></p>
</div></div></div></div></div><div class="image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__image-wrapper"><div class="media-renderer-module-scss-module__wcv5jq__wrapper image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__image-holder"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 648px, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Traders_02.png%3Fv%3D1764094928&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Traders_02.png%3Fv%3D1764094928&amp;w=750&amp;q=100 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Traders_02.png%3Fv%3D1764094928&amp;w=828&amp;q=100 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Traders_02.png%3Fv%3D1764094928&amp;w=1080&amp;q=100 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Traders_02.png%3Fv%3D1764094928&amp;w=1200&amp;q=100 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Traders_02.png%3Fv%3D1764094928&amp;w=1920&amp;q=100 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Traders_02.png%3Fv%3D1764094928&amp;w=2048&amp;q=100 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Traders_02.png%3Fv%3D1764094928&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Traders_02.png%3Fv%3D1764094928&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100"/></div></div></div></div></section><section class="image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__is-section image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__image-on-left light-primary"><div class="image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__container container"><div class="image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__holder"><div class="image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__content"><div class="image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__header"><div class="text-block-module-scss-module__VAyP-q__header text-block-module-scss-module__VAyP-q__is-inside-carousel"><h2 class="text-block-module-scss-module__VAyP-q__heading heading3 gsap-text-block-heading">Built for Traders &amp; Brokers</h2><div class="text-block-module-scss-module__VAyP-q__text body-m gsap-text-block-description"><p><span data-sheets-root="1">Traders, brokers and other market participants have relied on Xpansiv and our ecosystem for 25 years.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__items"><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item--active"><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-header"><h3 class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-heading ffaptosdisplay_4cb7a3de-module__KLyU8q__className heading5 bold">Unmatched leadership and expertise</h3></div><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-content gsap-accordion-5050-item-content-0"><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-progress gsap-accordion-5050-progress-0"></div><div><p><span data-sheets-root="1">Evolution Markets has been a leader in global carbon since the inception of cap-and-trade systems. CBL has offered breakthrough innovations like the Global Emissions Offset™ (GEO®) standardized contract and more recently the CBL GEO CORSIA CP1 and ICVCM CCP® standardized contracts. Across renewable energy, carbon, power and fuel, our market knowledge, product innovation and relationships equip customers to thrive in unpredictable markets.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item"><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-header"><h3 class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-heading ffaptosdisplay_4cb7a3de-module__KLyU8q__className heading5 bold">Unique pricing intelligence</h3></div><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-content gsap-accordion-5050-item-content-1"><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-progress gsap-accordion-5050-progress-1"></div><div><p><span data-sheets-root="1">Built on verified transaction and order data from CBL and Evolution Markets, Xpansiv Data provides invaluable insights, spanning real-time to historical data. The solution covers both environmental and energy markets for a comprehensive view of pricing, liquidity and trends.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item"><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-header"><h3 class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-heading ffaptosdisplay_4cb7a3de-module__KLyU8q__className heading5 bold">Exceptional product access</h3></div><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-content gsap-accordion-5050-item-content-2"><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-progress gsap-accordion-5050-progress-2"></div><div><p>In addition to standardized contracts, Xpansiv customers can find and transact a vast range of project-specific credits, filtered by project type, registry, vintage, region and country. Whether you’re seeking voluntary or compliance RECs from a specific country or U.S. state, carbon credits with a particular profile, compliance or voluntary clean fuel certificates or another instrument, you can rely on Xpansiv to help you meet your objectives.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item"><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-header"><h3 class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-heading ffaptosdisplay_4cb7a3de-module__KLyU8q__className heading5 bold">Streamlining the complete commodity lifecycle</h3></div><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-content gsap-accordion-5050-item-content-3"><div class="accordion-5050-module-scss-module__28XtEW__item-progress gsap-accordion-5050-progress-3"></div><div><p><span data-sheets-root="1">Xpansiv offers tools and support every step of the way – from research and price intelligence to transacting, tracking and reporting. You can even settle OTC transactions via CBL’s post-trade settlement mechanism, enabling trades with hundreds of qualified exchange participants without bilateral agreements.</span></p>
</div></div></div></div></div><div class="image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__image-wrapper"><div class="media-renderer-module-scss-module__wcv5jq__wrapper image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__image-holder"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 648px, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Registries_Hero-1.jpg%3Fv%3D1763493015&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Registries_Hero-1.jpg%3Fv%3D1763493015&amp;w=750&amp;q=100 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Registries_Hero-1.jpg%3Fv%3D1763493015&amp;w=828&amp;q=100 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Registries_Hero-1.jpg%3Fv%3D1763493015&amp;w=1080&amp;q=100 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Registries_Hero-1.jpg%3Fv%3D1763493015&amp;w=1200&amp;q=100 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Registries_Hero-1.jpg%3Fv%3D1763493015&amp;w=1920&amp;q=100 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Registries_Hero-1.jpg%3Fv%3D1763493015&amp;w=2048&amp;q=100 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Registries_Hero-1.jpg%3Fv%3D1763493015&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F11%2FXP_Registries_Hero-1.jpg%3Fv%3D1763493015&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100"/></div></div></div></div></section><section class="image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__is-section light-secondary"><div class="image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__container container"><div class="image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__holder"><div class="image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__content"><div class="image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__header"><div class="text-block-module-scss-module__VAyP-q__header text-block-module-scss-module__VAyP-q__is-inside-carousel"><h2 class="text-block-module-scss-module__VAyP-q__heading heading3 gsap-text-block-heading">Learn more about the Xpansiv toolkit for traders and brokers</h2><div class="text-block-module-scss-module__VAyP-q__text body-m gsap-text-block-description"><p><span data-sheets-root="1">Take advantage of our complete platform to help you execute profitably and operate efficiently.</span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="module-5050-module-scss-module__AAKDNq__items"></div></div><div class="image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__image-wrapper"><div class="media-renderer-module-scss-module__wcv5jq__wrapper image-5050-module-scss-module__EIOLdq__image-holder"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 648px, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FXP_Platform_Overview_R8_Mobile_Square.png%3Fv%3D1785147450&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FXP_Platform_Overview_R8_Mobile_Square.png%3Fv%3D1785147450&amp;w=750&amp;q=100 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FXP_Platform_Overview_R8_Mobile_Square.png%3Fv%3D1785147450&amp;w=828&amp;q=100 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FXP_Platform_Overview_R8_Mobile_Square.png%3Fv%3D1785147450&amp;w=1080&amp;q=100 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FXP_Platform_Overview_R8_Mobile_Square.png%3Fv%3D1785147450&amp;w=1200&amp;q=100 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FXP_Platform_Overview_R8_Mobile_Square.png%3Fv%3D1785147450&amp;w=1920&amp;q=100 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FXP_Platform_Overview_R8_Mobile_Square.png%3Fv%3D1785147450&amp;w=2048&amp;q=100 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FXP_Platform_Overview_R8_Mobile_Square.png%3Fv%3D1785147450&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.xpansiv.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F07%2FXP_Platform_Overview_R8_Mobile_Square.png%3Fv%3D1785147450&amp;w=3840&am