</div><a class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__link" aria-label="Explore Evolution Markets" href="/markets/evolution-markets"></a><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__btn"><span>Explore Evolution Markets</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 8 13" class=""><path fill="currentColor" d="M1.585.54 7.21 6.165a.563.563 0 0 1 0 .796l-5.625 5.625a.563.563 0 0 1-.795-.796l5.227-5.227L.79 1.336A.563.563 0 0 1 1.585.54"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__has-link cards-module-scss-module__jhX6tq__item"><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__item-inner"><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__item-holder"><h3 class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__item-heading heading4">Xpansiv® Data™</h3><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__item-text"><p>Transaction-based, real-time and historical market data</p>
</div><a class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__link" aria-label="Explore Data" href="/data"></a><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__btn"><span>Explore Data</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 8 13" class=""><path fill="currentColor" d="M1.585.54 7.21 6.165a.563.563 0 0 1 0 .796l-5.625 5.625a.563.563 0 0 1-.795-.796l5.227-5.227L.79 1.336A.563.563 0 0 1 1.585.54"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__has-link cards-module-scss-module__jhX6tq__item"><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__item-inner"><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__item-holder"><h3 class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__item-heading heading4">Xpansiv® Connect™</h3><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__item-text"><p><span data-sheets-root="1">Unified portfolio visibility and management across registries</span></p>
</div><a class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__link" aria-label="Explore Connect" href="/connect"></a><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__btn"><span>Explore Connect</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 8 13" class=""><path fill="currentColor" d="M1.585.54 7.21 6.165a.563.563 0 0 1 0 .796l-5.625 5.625a.563.563 0 0 1-.795-.796l5.227-5.227L.79 1.336A.563.563 0 0 1 1.585.54"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__has-link cards-module-scss-module__jhX6tq__item"><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__item-inner"><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__item-holder"><h3 class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__item-heading heading4">Xpansiv® Registries™</h3><div class="card-module-scss-module__Vi0IrW__item-text"><p><span style="font-weight:400">NAR, TIGR, Xpansiv I-REC and other registries for asset registration, issuance, tracking and retirement</span></p>
